      "filePath": "packages/opencode/src/cli/cmd/tui/context/theme.tsx",
      "summary": "The TUI theme engine — merges built-in, custom (JSON files on disk), and terminal-derived system themes; resolves color references (hex, ANSI-16/256, alias chains) to concrete RGBA values and generates complete themes including grayscale ramps, muted text colors, and tree-sitter syntax highlighting rules.",
      "tags": ["theme", "color", "syntax-highlighting", "state-management", "context-provider"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "The system theme is synthesized from the terminal's 16-color palette via renderer.getPalette; a 500-line table in getSyntaxRules maps theme roles to tree-sitter scopes, and custom themes are discovered by globbing global and project theme directories."
